<title>USA: Coca-Cola launches drinks for Taiwan market.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola launches drinks for Taiwan market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Co said Friday it launched its first brand of soft drinks created for the Taiwan market.</p>
<p>The drinks sell under the Fei Yang brand name -- which translated into English, means &quot;Flying High&quot;.</p>
<p>The brand includes indigenous teas and fruit juice drinks designed to appeal to young people, the company said.</p>
<p>The company did not say how much it would spend on the launch. It has about a 35 percent share of the Taiwan market to date, it said.</p>
</text>
